import{_ as i,o,c as n,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 277 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Martial-Way Knowledge Popularization: The Boundary and Ceiling of Popularization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 277 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Martial-Way Knowledge Popularization: The Boundary and Ceiling of Popularization","no":277,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Martial-Way Popularization","Knowledge-Popularization Boundary","Popularization Ceiling","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism","69-Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism","08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0277_模块2-唐罗-武道知识普及批判.md","filePath":"en/0277_模块2-唐罗-武道知识普及批判.md"}'),a={name:"en/0277_模块2-唐罗-武道知识普及批判.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,d,p){return o(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-277-tang-luo-decomposition-critique-of-martial-way-knowledge-popularization-the-boundary-and-ceiling-of-popularization" tabindex="-1">Entry 277 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Martial-Way Knowledge Popularization: The Boundary and Ceiling of Popularization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-277-tang-luo-decomposition-critique-of-martial-way-knowledge-popularization-the-boundary-and-ceiling-of-popularization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 277 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Martial-Way Knowledge Popularization: The Boundary and Ceiling of Popularization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 27)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-popularization-is-real-popularization-but-popularization-has-a-boundary" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Popularization is real popularization, but popularization has a boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-popularization-is-real-popularization-but-popularization-has-a-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Popularization is real popularization, but popularization has a boundary&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom requires Great Dao all-tier openness. Tang Luo popularized martial-way knowledge; this is one of his most praiseworthy good policies. But popularization has a boundary — inside the boundary is good policy, outside the boundary is another kind of monopoly. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, dissecting popularization&#39;s boundary. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Boundary-caused energy-level waste of popularization:</p><ul><li><strong>Incomplete-version popularization</strong>: methods Tang Luo popularizes are mostly &quot;basic version,&quot; &quot;streamlined version.&quot; True formulas, mind-methods, incantations still circulate only within Tang Luo&#39;s direct-disciples circle. Students learn versions &quot;that can enter the door,&quot; cannot learn versions &quot;that can reach the top&quot;</li><li><strong>Q&amp;A right monopolized</strong>: students have problems in practice, can only seek Q&amp;A from Tang Luo or his direct disciples. Q&amp;A right itself is a resource, monopolized</li><li><strong>Advancement channel monopolized</strong>: from basic version to advanced version, requires &quot;taking a master&quot; to unlock. Popularization&#39;s end is a new threshold</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>popularization lets ten thousand enter the door, but the road from entry to summit is paved as a tolled secondary highway.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Knowledge dualization</strong>: the popularized &quot;public version&quot; and privately hoarded &quot;true-formula version&quot; form two knowledge tiers. The public version trains mid-tier, the true-formula version trains top tier</li><li><strong>Master-disciple revival</strong>: because advancement requires taking a master, the master-disciple relationship again becomes cultivation circles&#39; core. Tang Luo overthrew aristocratic master-disciple monopoly, then personally rebuilt his own master-disciple monopoly</li><li><strong>Popularization illusion</strong>: the world sees &quot;everyone may learn,&quot; mistakenly thinking knowledge is fully open. Actually the most critical part is still locked — popularization became a smoke screen obscuring monopoly</li></ol><p>Regression form: on the surface knowledge popularized, actually knowledge stratified.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Fragmentary chapters hook disciples</strong>: popularizing incomplete versions is to hook talented students to come take disciples. This is knowledge popularization&#39;s most hidden commercialization design</li><li><strong>Q&amp;A right is power</strong>: whoever can answer questions holds interpretation right. Tang Luo clutching interpretation right is clutching knowledge&#39;s meaning</li><li><strong>Popularization is control</strong>: popularization is not to let all beings stand on their own, but to guide all beings toward directions Tang Luo wishes. Popularization is the gentlest guidance technique</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, popularization is his predation structure&#39;s concrete form of &quot;knowledge stratification.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Popularization Boundary</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis All-Tier Openness</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Incomplete-version popularization</td><td>Complete methods + all commentaries + all deduction processes, uploaded at once</td></tr><tr><td>Q&amp;A right monopolized</td><td>Alaya Network collaborative Q&amp;A, billion-plus mentors and students participating</td></tr><tr><td>Taking a master unlocks advancement</td><td>Advancement no threshold, auto-opened by progress</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge dualization</td><td>Single knowledge layer, distinction between public and hoarded disappears</td></tr><tr><td>Popularization = guidance</td><td>Knowledge neutrally public, learners choose direction themselves</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: popularization is not &quot;giving part,&quot; but &quot;giving all&quot; — including true formulas, commentaries, deduction processes.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Tang-Luo popularization model, marking public/true-formula ratio</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A incomplete popularization; Group B full openness</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: independent success rate within a hundred years, master-disciple attachment rate</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B independent success rate ten times Group A, master-disciple attachment rate approaches zero</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. Fragmentary chapters hooking disciples is a classic web-novel design</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Long-form late if it needs new unique moves, the cheapest move is &quot;Tang Luo comprehended a new true formula again&quot; — knowledge stock stretches with plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: incomplete popularization makes students reinvent true formulas</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: fragmentary chapters hooking disciples = knowledge commercialization</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo popularized 90%, locks the 10% true formula</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: true formulas not open, 99% can never reach the top</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: all-tier openness is the precondition for cross-plane cooperation</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-boundary-design-of-knowledge-popularization" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Boundary Design of Knowledge Popularization <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-boundary-design-of-knowledge-popularization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Boundary Design of Knowledge Popularization&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo system&#39;s martial-way knowledge popularization boundary and ceiling are essentially knowledge monopoly remnants. Heng Yuan Zhou through the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization fully opens the 300 cultivation systems; the Alaya Network provides full-chain teaching resources from entry to hyper-multiverse. The law-first axiom ensures knowledge openness has a ladder: low-tier knowledge fully open, high-tier knowledge requires corresponding realm&#39;s law understanding as entry threshold — not hoarding, but preventing low-realm beings from misusing high-tier laws and causing disasters. The universal equal infinite law ensures openness is not alms, but everyone&#39;s inherent evolution right.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Popularization is Tang Luo&#39;s best deed, but popularization&#39;s boundary is precisely his most incomplete place. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment: popularization is not giving part, but giving all. Giving part&#39;s popularization is advertising; giving all&#39;s popularization is liberation.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./18-修炼资源开放机制.html">18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism</a> · <a href="./69-技术开放与共享机制.html">69-Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism</a> · <a href="./08-人人有路保障体系.html">08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{c as __pageData,g as default};
